== Trivia ==
* Famine appeared in the original ''The Binding of Isaac.''
* Famine is one of the [[wikipedia:Four Horsemen of the Apocalypse|Four Horsemen of the Apocalypse]] mentioned in the Bible. However, in the Bible, Famine is depicted as riding a black horse rather than the tan horse seen in-game.
* A famine is the scarcity of food over a large area, which can explain Famine's emaciated appearance.
* Famine is shown with pupils in his Rebirth artwork, which is absent in his original artwork. This is slightly averted with his ultra form.
* The Pooters Famine spawns may be a reference to the many insect-caused famines.
* {{dlc|r}} Blue Champion Famine's cleft lip is a reference to {{E|Monstro}}'s iconic cleft lip, as he uses a similar projectile cluster attack to Monstro in his second phase.

== Bugs ==
{{bug|If phase 2 of Famine is inflicted with [[fear]] or [[confusion]], instead of running away from Isaac, it will chase him without attacking.}}
{{bug|If Famine is [[confusion|stunned]] at the same time as he tries to shoot Isaac after the effect wears off, his shots will be fired without his corresponding animation.}}

